flowchart LR
    Customer[Storefront or API caller] --> Commerce[Independent Java services]
    Commerce -->|HTTP W3C context| Commerce
    Commerce -->|JDBC spans| OwnerDB[(Service-owned PostgreSQL)]
    Commerce -->|OTLP internal HTTP| Collector["Collector allowlists, cleared events/links/tracestate and bounded queues"]
    Collector -->|Request metrics| Prometheus[(Prometheus local)]
    Collector -->|Sanitized spans| Tempo[(Tempo local 24h)]
    Collector -->|Safe request logger only| Loki[(Loki local 24h)]
    Grafana[Grafana localhost:3001 admin/admin] --> Prometheus
    Grafana --> Tempo
    Grafana --> Loki
    Operator[Explicit telemetry up/down] -->|Preserve images and active services| Commerce
